    61	Full form, Codex and Seedream:
    62	
    63	```text
    64	Use the attached product photo as the only source for the product: keep its exact shape, proportions, colours, label layout and material; do not redraw or restyle it. Show it as a giant hyper-real anamorphic 3D display on the curved corner screen of a glass-and-steel office tower at a busy junction, leaning out past the screen's bezel. Late-afternoon sun low from camera-left; the screen's own light adds a cool fill to the pavement and facades. Photographed from street level across the junction, full-frame camera, 35 mm lens, slight upward tilt; passers-by blurred in motion in the foreground, a bus passing on the right. Real materials: brushed-metal bezel with fine scratches, glass with layered sky reflections, stained concrete. Natural exposure, restrained grade, fine grain; no glow, no HDR look, no readable faces. The screen carries no text and no logo; leave its lower band a plain dark panel for a mark added in post.
    65	```
