    78	| 5 Rewrite | same | one house prompt from the best candidates: observable detail, motivated light, named lens, material, restrained grade, bans as instructions; brands and persons stripped; cast and scene set; three forms | lint; lead spot-reads 10 % per slice |
    79	| 6 Translate | helper-writer | title_tr, desc_tr, aliases; grade-A CJK candidates to English before step 5 | parity in lint |
