    85	**5. First release**
    86	
    87	Shelves. Image: studio product, lifestyle, outdoor and OOH, platform ad formats, people and UGC stills, food and drink, fashion and accessories, cosmetics and skincare, real estate and interiors, automotive, poster and key visual, mockup and packaging, plus modifiers for light, camera, material, finish and format. Video: camera moves, product reveal, platform formats, UGC video, image-to-video, transitions, motion graphics.
    88	
    89	Width is a coverage rule, not a count: every shelf holds at least eight drafts, and three per shelf are sampled and seen before ship. Yield is measured, not promised.
    90	
    91	| At ship | Rough yield |
    92	|---|---|
    93	| drafts across 24 shelves | 200 to 300 |
    94	| tested core | 60 to 75 |
    95	
