ion ends. Also: decision **U44** in 00-INDEX and requirement rows **MSTU-01…10** in `.planning/REQUIREMENTS.md`, four built and six standing as registered gaps whose owner is W14 on his word. **F028 — waits on his word:** his founding order of 2026-09-03 as a written directive under `docs/ceo-directives/`. A file there carries authority layer 2 in HIS name and a text reconstructed from this row is the author's (the audit's own F003), so none was created; he was asked in the same session and has not answered. Ruler `CHECK-W13-2026-09-15.sh` (md5 `15e3af5ad40340657b4c43fd187c0d92`), dictated by the checker before the first line and committed alone; evidence `EVIDENCE-W13-2026-09-15.md`. **Also open on this row:** Hamza's persona record (v2, file v6 by Opus 5) refused by `enforce_persona_gate_on_activation`'s author list, which never learned U30 — a migration on both engines, parked as B08 step 0 · the project-creation door's missing `name_tr`/`purpose_tr` (set by hand for two projects) · the experts' SDK runs inherit the repository cwd and the session plugins' start context (`cwd` + `settingSources`, one line, behavioural — his call) · the studio's tab itself, gated on B32's approved drawing · the 004 file on disk (4,080,832 bytes) — his word whether it is deleted.<br>**W14 — THE ELEVEN FERRARI LEGS HE ORDERED FIRST, NOW OWNED LEGS ON THIS BOARD. WRITTEN 2026-09-16 ON HIS WORD *"başla"* — AND NOT ONE OF THEM IS BUILT.** <!-- OPEN: B43 --> **This is a REGISTRATION, not a construction** — the row's own acceptance test asks for each leg to carry an owner, a CEO-facing deliverable, an acceptance test and a SINGLE proving command, and asks explicitly that nothing be built until he approves. The eight findings the audit left open on this ground — F036, F066, F067, F068, F073, F074, F075, F077 — are each named on the leg that owns it; F073 alone carries four legs, because his engine floor of 2026-08-31 was four orders in one sentence. **THE ONE THING HE SHOULD KNOW BEFORE HE