31 tool on the shelf since 2026-10-21 (`rea` CLI, its skill, Ghidra) is granted to every employee of the holding, not one
32 department — given with this row's grant link when the row is built at its rank; the company engine waits for the key.
33 
34 **The design skills' bans (his word, 2026-10-28)** <!-- CEO-OK: design-skill-bans-are-design-knowledge-2026-10-28 -->. When the design skills are copied onto the holding's desk, their bans travel with them as design knowledge — put there to make design better, never blamed for a page that came out cold; only some are taken out, within reason, case by case.
35 **Risks.** A fetched page can carry hidden instructions (doctrine §1 item 6 stays); the walls bound what a fooled worker can reach. Tool search adds one search round per tool use.

